   "headline": "AI customers rise while their builders fall",
   "facts": [
    "Democrats won both Congressional chambers",
    "Big technology customers rose while data centre operators fell",
    "Reuters attributes split to expectations of slower infrastructure spending",
    "Texas and Georgia opposition creates uncertainty; no new law or project cancellation established"
